      "text": "<math><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  and  <math><mi>I</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  and  <math><mi>I</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
